			"date": "2025-03-24T13:59:38.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> yeah I'm guessing they use this tool, and I'm baffled that this would go unaddressed so long? <a href=\"https://github.com/anchore/grype/issues/1701\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/anchore/grype/issues/1701</a></p><p>name squatting has been an issue with npm forever, telling scoped packages and non scoped apart feels essential?</p>",
