			},
			"date": "2025-03-25T06:59:10.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> </p><p>ACTUALLY `name` was deprecated after two versions and now links to `<span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://techhub.social/@name\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>name</span></a></span>/name` which contains the same code.</p><p>They're completely different.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
