			"content": "<p>Another update: the socket.dev folks fixed this on their end almost immediately but this has now also been fixed upstream in `grype` too: <a href=\"https://github.com/anchore/grype/issues/1701\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">github.com/anchore/grype/issue</span><span class=\"invisible\">s/1701</span></a></p><p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://social.chriswb.dev/@chrisw_b\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>chrisw_b</span></a></span></p>",
